   "source": [
    "MODE = 'OFFLINE'  # 'OFFLINE'（离线）或 'ONLINE'（在线，需要 ft env）\n",
    "\n",
    "import json, hashlib, time\n",
    "print(f'MODE = {MODE}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "s1-md",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. RLHF → DPO 演进 —— 为什么不用 reward model？\n",
    "\n",
    "**传统 RLHF（3 步）**：\n",
    "1. SFT：训出初始模型\n",
    "2. 训练 reward model（GPT-4 / Claude / 专用奖励模型）\n",
    "3. PPO：用 reward model 训练基座模型\n",
    "\n",
    "**问题**：reward model 训练成本高、不稳定、容易训崩。\n",
    "\n",
    "**DPO（2023 论文）**：\n",
    "- **不用 reward model**，直接用偏好对优化\n",
    "- 数学推导：PPO 的损失函数可以等价转化成只用 (prompt, chosen, rejected) 的损失\n",
    "- 优点：\n",
    "  - 简化流程（少一步）\n",
    "  - 更稳定（不训 reward model）\n",
    "  - 实现简单（TRL 的 DPOTrainer 5 行代码）"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "s1-c1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# OFFLINE 模式：模拟 DPO vs RLHF 的流程对比\n",
    "\n",
    "def simulate_rlhf_dpo_comparison():\n",
    "    print('=== RLHF（3 步）vs DPO（2 步）对比 ===')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    rlhf_steps = {\n",
    "        'SFT (LoRA)': '5-10 分钟',\n",
    "        '训练 reward model': '2-4 小时（用 GPT-4 API）',\n",
    "        'PPO (训练基座)': '1-3 小时'\n",
    "    }\n",
    "    \n",
    "    dpo_steps = {\n",
    "        'SFT (LoRA)': '5-10 分钟',\n",
    "        '准备偏好对': '10-30 分钟（Claude/DeepSeek API 生成）',\n",
    "        'DPO 训练': '1-3 小时'\n",
    "    }\n",
    "    \n",
    "    print('\\n--- RLHF 流程 ---')\n",
    "    for step, time_str in rlhf_steps.items():\n",
    "        print(f'  {step:25s} -> {time_str}')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    print('\\n--- DPO 流程 ---')\n",
    "    for step, time_str in dpo_steps.items():\n",
    "        print(f'  {step:25s} -> {time_str}')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    print('\\n--- 关键差异 ---')\n",
    "    print('  RLHF 需要训 reward model，成本高且不稳定')\n",
    "    print('  DPO 直接用偏好对，流程短且稳定')\n",
    "\n",
    "simulate_rlhf_dpo_comparison()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "s2-md",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. 偏好数据格式 —— {\"prompt\", \"chosen\", \"rejected\"}\n",
    "\n",
    "**偏好对（preference pair）**是 DPO 的核心数据格式：\n",
    "- `prompt`：用户问题\n",
    "- `chosen`：好的回答（模型应该学的）\n",
    "- `rejected`：坏的回答（模型应该避开的）\n",
    "\n",
    "**数据量**：1000-10000 条高质量偏好对通常就能看到效果（>1000）。\n",
    "\n",
    "**要求**：chosen > rejected，prefer 意义上（如更准确、更详细、更安全）。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "s2-c1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# OFFLINE 模式：构造 300 条偏好对示例\n",
    "\n",
    "# 生成 10 条 prompt\n",
    "prompts = [\n",
    "    '解释 Transformer 的自注意力机制。',\n",
    "    'LoRA 的数学原理是什么？',\n",
    "    'RAG 的优缺点分别是什么？',\n",
    "    '为什么 GPU 对大模型训练很重要？',\n",
    "    'ChatGPT 是怎么训练的？',\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "def generate_preference_pairs(prompts, n_pairs=10):\n",
    "    \"\"\"模拟生成偏好对（OFFLINE）\"\"\"\n",
    "    preference_data = []\n",
    "    \n",
    "    for prompt in prompts[:n_pairs]:\n",
    "        # chosen：好的回答（详细）\n",
    "        chosen = f\"好的，Transformer 的自注意力机制是...\（详细展开）\"\n",
    "        # rejected：坏的回答（简略、错误）\n",
    "        rejected = \"Transformer 的自注意力机制。\"\n",
    "        \n",
    "        preference_data.append({\n",
    "            'prompt': prompt,\n",
    "            'chosen': chosen,\n",
    "            'rejected': rejected\n",
    "        })\n",
    "    \n",
    "    return preference_data\n",
    "\n",
    "PREF_DATA = generate_preference_pairs(prompts, n_pairs=5)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'共 {len(PREF_DATA)} 条偏好对示例（OFFLINE 模拟）')\n",
    "for i, pair in enumerate(PREF_DATA):\n",
    "    print(f'\\n[{i}]')\n",
    "    print(f'  prompt: {pair[\"prompt\"]}')\n",
    "    print(f'  chosen: {pair[\"chosen\"][:50]}...')\n",
    "    print(f'  rejected: {pair[\"rejected\"][:50]}...')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "s2-c2",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 保存为 JSONL（真实格式）\n",
    "\n",
    "output_file = 'dpo_preference_pairs.jsonl'\n",
    "with open(output_file, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n",
    "    for pair in PREF_DATA:\n",
    "        f.write(json.dumps(pair, ensure_ascii=False) + '\\n')\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'已保存 {len(PREF_DATA)} 条偏好对到 {output_file}')\n",
    "print('\\n文件前两行示例：')\n",
    "with open(output_file, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n",
    "    print(f.read()[:300])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "s3-md",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. TRL DPOTrainer 最小脚本（OFFLINE 模拟）\n",
    "\n",
    "TRL 的 `DPOTrainer` 使用方法与 `SFTTrainer` 几乎一样：\n",
    "```python\n",
    "from trl import DPOTrainer\n",
    "\n",
    "dpo_trainer = DPOTrainer(\n",
    "    model=base_model,\n",
    "    ref_model=ref_model,  # 引用模型（通常是未微调的基座）\n",
    "    train_dataset=train_dataset,\n",
    "    tokenizer=tokenizer,\n",
    "    beta=0.1,  # DPO 超参\n",
    "    args=training_args,\n",
    ")\n",
    "dpo_trainer.train()\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "s3-c1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# OFFLINE 模式：模拟 DPOTrainer 训练\n",
    "\n",
    "def simulate_dpo_train(prompts, beta=0.1, epochs=2, steps=10):\n",
    "    \"\"\"模拟 DPO 训练过程（仅作演示）\"\"\"\n",
    "    print(f'开始 DPO 训练: beta={beta}, epochs={epochs}, steps={steps}')\n",
    "    print(f'训练数据: {len(prompts)} 条偏好对')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    losses = []\n",
    "    for epoch in range(epochs):\n",
    "        epoch_loss = 0\n",
    "        for step in range(steps):\n",
    "            # DPO loss 通常比 SFT 稍大，下降较慢\n",
    "            loss = max(0.6, 2.8 * (1 - (epoch * steps + step) / (epochs * steps)))\n",
    "            losses.append(loss)\n",
    "            epoch_loss += loss\n",
    "        print(f'  Epoch {epoch+1}: avg_loss = {epoch_loss/steps:.3f}')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    return losses\n",
    "\n",
    "losses = simulate_dpo_train(prompts[:3], beta=0.1, epochs=2, steps=10)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'\\n最终 eval_loss: {losses[-1]:.3f}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "s4-md",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. 数据合成实战 —— 用 Claude/DeepSeek 生成偏好对\n",
    "\n",
    "**数据合成流程**：\n",
    "1. 用强模型（Claude/GPT-4/DeepSeek）生成 `(prompt, answer)` 样本\n",
    "2. 对每个 prompt 生成 2-3 个候选回答\n",
    "3. 人工抽检 5-10% 确保质量\n",
    "4. 保存为偏好对格式\n",
    "\n",
    "**工具**：\n",
    "- Argilla Distilabel：流水线数据合成工具\n",
    "- 自定义脚本：调用 API 生成 → 解析 → 验证"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "s4-c1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# OFFLINE 模式：模拟数据合成脚本\n",
    "\n",
    "def simulate_data_synthesis(domain, n_samples=1000, check_ratio=0.05):\n",
    "    \"\"\"模拟数据合成流程（OFFLINE）\"\"\"\n",
    "    print(f'=== 模拟 {domain} 数据合成 ===')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 步骤 1：用强模型生成候选回答\n",
    "    print(f'步骤 1: 生成 {n_samples} 条样本...')\n",
    "    raw_samples = [\n",
    "        {'prompt': f'什么是 {domain} 中的 X？', 'answer': f'{domain} 中的 X 是...（强模型生成的回答）'}\n",
    "        for _ in range(n_samples)\n",
    "    ]\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 步骤 2：人工抽检（OFFLINE 模拟）\n",
    "    check_count = int(n_samples * check_ratio)\n",
    "    print(f'步骤 2: 人工抽检 {check_count} 条 ({check_ratio*100:.1f}%)...')\n",
    "    checked = raw_samples[:check_count]\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 步骤 3：转为偏好对\n",
    "    preference_pairs = []\n",
    "    for item in checked:\n",
    "        # chosen：强模型生成的（好）\n",
    "        # rejected：弱模型生成的（坏）\n",
    "        preference_pairs.append({\n",
    "            'prompt': item['prompt'],\n",
    "            'chosen': item['answer'],\n",
    "            'rejected': f'弱模型生成的回答（较简略）'\n",
    "        })\n",
    "    \n",
    "    print(f'步骤 3: 生成 {len(preference_pairs)} 条偏好对')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    return preference_pairs\n",
    "\n",
    "# 模拟生成 1000 条代码审查领域的偏好对\n",
    "code_pref_data = simulate_data_synthesis('代码审查', n_samples=1000, check_ratio=0.1)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'\\n最终生成偏好对数: {len(code_pref_data)}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "s5-md",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. C-Eval / CMMLU 接入 + 微调前后对比\n",
    "\n",
    "**评估指标**：\n",
    "- 基础能力：MMLU / CMMLU / C-Eval（常识 / 科目综合）\n",
    "- 领域能力：领域 eval set（自建）\n",
    "- 风格 / 安全：拒答率 / 输出风格\n",
    "\n",
    "**C-Eval（中文综合评估）**：\n",
    "- 52 个科目（STEM / 人文 / 社科）\n",
    "- 13 个年级（高中 / 大学 / 硕士 / 博士）\n",
    "- 结果是百分制平均分\n",
    "\n",
    "**CMMLU（中文多任务理解）**：\n",
    "- 12680 个问题\n",
    - 9 类科目（综合 / 科学 / 工程 / 社会科学 / 人文学科等）\n",
    "- 中文场景首选"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "s5-c1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# OFFLINE 模式：对比微调前后 C-Eval 分数\n",
    "\n",
    "def simulate_ceval_score(before_score, improvement, n_questions=100):\n",
    "    \"\"\"模拟 C-Eval 分数（OFFLINE）\"\"\"\n",
    "    print(f'=== 模拟 C-Eval 对比（{n_questions} 题）===')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 生成模拟题目分数\n",
    "    before_scores = [\n",
    "        min(100, max(0, before_score + (0.5 - random.random()) * 10))\n",
    "        for _ in range(n_questions)\n",
    "    ]\n",
    "    after_scores = [\n",
    "        min(100, max(0, after_score + (0.5 - random.random()) * 10))\n",
    "        for _ in range(n_questions)\n",
    "    ]\n",
    "    \n",
    "    before_avg = sum(before_scores) / len(before_scores)\n",
    "    after_avg = sum(after_scores) / len(after_scores)\n",
    "    gain = after_avg - before_avg\n",
    "    \n",
    "    print(f'微调前平均分: {before_avg:.1f}')\n",
    "    print(f'微调后平均分: {after_avg:.1f}')\n",
    "    print(f'提升: +{gain:.1f} 分 ({gain/before_avg*100:.1f}%)')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    return after_avg\n",
    "\n",
    "# 导入随机（OFFLINE 模拟用）\n",
    "import random\n",
    "\n",
    "print('=== 场景 1：通用微调（基准分 70）===')\n",
    "after_score_1 = simulate_ceval_score(before_score=70, improvement=5, n_questions=50)\n",
    "\n",
    "print('\\n=== 场景 2：领域微调（基准分 75）===')\n",
    "after_score_2 = simulate_ceval_score(before_score=75, improvement=8, n_questions=50)\n",
    "\n",
    "print('\\n=== 总结 ===')\n",
    "print(f'通用微调: 70 -> {after_score_1:.1f} (+{after_score_1-70:.1f})')\n",
    "print(f'领域微调: 75 -> {after_score_2:.1f} (+{after_score_2-75:.1f})')"
   ]
  },
  {
